### Smart Farming Advisory System - API Testing

### Create Farmer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/farmers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Jean Paul Habimana",
    "location": "Kigali, Rwanda",
    "phoneNumber": "+250780001001"
}

### Create Crop
POST http://localhost:8080/api/crops
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "cropName": "Maize",
    "idealSoil": "Loam",
    "idealSeason": "Rainy"
}

### Create Disease
POST http://localhost:8080/api/diseases
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "symptoms": "Yellowing leaves and stunted growth",
    "preventionMethod": "Use resistant varieties and proper drainage",
    "medicineType": "Fungicide treatment"
}

### Create Fertilizer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/fertilizers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nutrientContent": "NPK 20-10-10",
    "recommendedDose": "50 kg/hectare"
}

### Get All Farmers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/farmers

### Get All Crops
GET http://localhost:8080/api/crops

### Get Crop Recommendations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/crops/recommend?soil=Loam&season=Rainy

### Get Crop Advice for Farmer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recommendations/crop-advice
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "farmerId": 1,
    "soilType": "Loam",
    "season": "Rainy"
}

### Get Disease Advice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recommendations/disease-advice
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "farmerId": 1,
    "cropId": 1,
    "symptoms": "Yellowing leaves"
}

### Get Fertilizer Advice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recommendations/fertilizer-advice
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "farmerId": 1,
    "cropId": 1
}

### Update Farmer
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/farmers/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Jean Paul Habimana Updated",
    "location": "Kigali, Rwanda",
    "phoneNumber": "+250780001001"
}

### Delete Farmer
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/farmers/1
